<Base title="隐私政策" titleEn="Privacy">
  <div class="container page-hero"><div class="eyebrow" data-zh="隐私">Privacy</div><h1 data-zh="尽可能少地收集。">Data, with restraint.</h1><p class="lead" data-zh="以下为产品隐私政策草案，正式上线前需经营者审核确认。">Draft privacy policy. The operator must review and approve it before public launch.</p></div>
  <article class="container legal"><h2 data-zh="我们处理什么">What we process</h2><p data-zh="邮箱用于账户验证和密码重置；生成余额与消费流水由服务端记录。生成回复时，当前 X 帖子内容、你提供的风格与写作样本会经平台后端发送至 DeepSeek 处理。">Your email supports account verification and password reset. Credits and usage are stored server-side. To generate a draft, the current X post and style information you provide are sent to DeepSeek through our backend.</p><h2 data-zh="我们不收集什么">What we avoid</h2><p data-zh="不收集 X Cookie，不自动发布评论，不长期存储完整原帖或回复正文。旧版本本地保存的个人 Key 在风格迁移后会被移除。">We do not collect your X cookies or post replies for you. Full post and reply text is not retained long-term. An older personal key is removed from extension storage after style migration.</p><h2 data-zh="保留与删除">Retention and deletion</h2><p data-zh="验证码短时有效；生成结果暂存 10 分钟用于安全重试，已完成的 AI 请求元数据保留 30 天；额度流水与订单在账户存续期间保留。账户删除与数据请求渠道待正式上线前确认。">Codes expire quickly. Generated output is kept for 10 minutes for safe retries, completed AI request metadata for 30 days. Credit ledger and orders are kept for the account lifetime. Account deletion and data request channels require review before launch.</p><p class="notice" data-zh="草案：本页尚未经过经营者或法律专业人士最终审核。">Draft: this page has not received final operator or legal review.</p></article>
</Base>
